      "title": "⓪ 這支範本不需要任何模型 / No models needed",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n這支範本**不需要任何模型檔** — 全新安裝、什麼模型都還沒放的 worker 也能直接跑。\n用途：把一張圖定格幾秒，接在一支影片的開頭，很適合當片頭卡。\n\n沒有 GPU 密集運算，跑起來很快，很適合拿來確認整條聯邦派工流程是通的。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nThis template needs **zero model files** — a brand-new worker with nothing\ndownloaded yet can run it as-is.\nWhat it does: holds one still image for a few seconds and prepends it to a\nvideo clip, like a title card.\n\nNo heavy GPU compute involved, so it runs fast — a good way to confirm the\nfederation pipeline works end to end."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
