      "title": "① 紅框節點=你要改的地方 / Red-framed nodes to edit",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n紅框的四個節點就是你要改的地方：\n\n- `LoadImage` — 換成你要當開場的圖（拖圖到節點上傳，或用下拉選單選暫存區的檔案）。\n- `ImageScale` 的 `width`/`height` — 改成跟你的影片畫面**一樣的尺寸**，\n  不一樣的話接起來會變形或報錯。\n- `RepeatImageBatch` 的 `amount` — 開場要停留幾秒，公式是\n  **開場秒數 × 影片 fps**。範本影片是 24fps，`amount=48` 就是停 2 秒；\n  想要 3 秒就改成 72。\n- `LoadVideo` — 換成你要接在開場後面的影片。\n\n其他節點不用動。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nThe four red-framed nodes are the only things you need to touch:\n`LoadImage` (swap in your intro picture), `ImageScale`'s `width`/`height`\n(match your video's frame size, or the join will distort or error),\n`RepeatImageBatch`'s `amount` (intro seconds × video fps — the sample clip is\n24 fps, so `amount=48` holds for 2 seconds; use 72 for 3 seconds), and\n`LoadVideo` (swap in the clip that follows the intro)."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1100,
        -480
      ],
      "size": [
        320,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 10,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "② 中段在做什麼 / What the middle section does",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n把靜止的圖片變成好幾張一模一樣的畫面（等於讓它定格 N 秒），\n再把這些畫面接到影片的畫面前面，聲音則直接沿用影片本身的聲音，\n最後合成一支新影片。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nTurns the still image into a run of identical frames (i.e. holds it for N\nseconds), prepends those frames to the video's own frames, keeps the\nvideo's own audio untouched, and muxes the result into one clip."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
